---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="UDealProxy 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/proxy`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回代理列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/udealproxy.webp`} alt="UDealProxy" class="max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-1">UDealProxy 深度评测</h1>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">全球住宅代理，静态动态双模式</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">评分概览</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">综合评分</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">全球覆盖</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">代理稳定性</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">协议支持</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">性价比</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">产品概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          UDealProxy 是一家全球住宅代理服务商，提供静态住宅和动态住宅两种代理模式。支持 HTTP/HTTPS 和 SOCKS5 协议，覆盖全球多个地区。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          住宅代理 IP 合规采购，保证高匿名性和稳定性。多语言支持界面，香港服务器托管（阿里云），SSL 安全加密。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          适合数据采集、账号管理、广告验证等场景。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">核心特性详解</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">静态住宅代理</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">固定 IP 适合需要长期稳定身份的场景。100% 独享，适合账号管理和电商运营。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">动态住宅代理</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">自动 IP 轮换适合大规模数据采集。全球 IP 池覆盖，灵活应对不同地区的采集需求。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">HTTP/SOCKS5 双协议</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">支持 HTTP/HTTPS 和 SOCKS5 协议，兼容各类爬虫框架和应用工具。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">多语言 + 安全</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">多语言界面支持全球用户。香港阿里云托管，SSL 加密保障数据传输安全。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">适用场景详细分析</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">1. 数据采集</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">动态住宅自动轮换 IP，适合大规模爬虫和价格监控任务。SOCKS5 协议兼容性广泛。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2. 账号管理</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">静态住宅固定 IP 提供稳定身份，适合社交账号管理和电商店铺运营。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">3. 广告验证</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">住宅 IP 高匿名性适合广告投放验证和品牌保护。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>静态/动态双模式</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>HTTP/SOCKS5 支持</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>全球覆盖</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>多语言界面</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.964-.833-2.732 0L3.34 16.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>品牌较新知名度低</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无移动代理选项</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>IP 池规模有限</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          UDealProxy 以静态和动态住宅代理双模式为核心，为数据采集和账号管理等场景提供了灵活的代理解决方案。HTTP/SOCKS5 双协议兼容性良好。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          综合评估，UDealProxy 获得 7.0 分，适合中小规模数据采集和账号管理需求的用户。
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://www.udealproxy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 UDealProxy 官网
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>